# Direct messages

The product label is «Сообщения». Do not rename that menu item, the header control, or the list heading to «Переписки».

The full file map and edit checklist are in `.cursor/skills/trenio-messages/SKILL.md`. Product behavior stays in `docs/TECH_SPEC.md` §4.6.

## Who may talk

- One open conversation per account and one published trainer or club profile. No user-to-user chat and no support inbox.
- The initiator uses `/account/messages`. The profile owner uses `/trainer-admin/messages`. Staff read other people's threads at `/admin/messages` and do not write there unless they are a participant.
- Trainer cards and the profile block after reviews («Как со мной связаться») use icon links: a phone handset, Instagram, Telegram, email, and a direct message. Instagram, Telegram, email, and the direct message open in a new tab. The handset is a `tel:` link and stays on this page. On the profile the formatted number sits beside the handset. Hide the direct icon when the slug is in `messaging.ownedSlugs`. A guest’s direct icon goes to login and returns to the same thread.
- The owner or staff may close a thread. A participant cannot hide or delete it. The row stays for both sides. It is removed for everyone only when an account is deleted.
- A blocked pair cannot send. A profile must be published.
- One user may message at most 10 different trainers per Europe/Minsk calendar day. The 11th is refused in a `CabinetNotice` popup. Repeating a trainer already messaged that day is allowed. Count the initiator's sent messages, not the owner's replies.

## Text and chrome

- Count visible graphemes with `reviewTextLength` after `sanitizeReviewHtml`. The initiator's first message is 1000. Later messages are 4000. Stored HTML may be 12000 (`messages_body_len`).
- The composer is one box: toolbar, field, then the counter and «Отправить» on the same row. Enter sends. Shift+Enter inserts a line break.
- Emoji are written into the editor value (insert a text node, then dispatch `input`). The picker includes every skin tone and the vulgar group.
- The sender sees «Доставлено» after the server stores the message, and «Прочитано» when the other participant's `last_read_message_id` is at least that id. An unowned profile stays «Доставлено».
- The messages icon is an envelope. The reviews icon stays a speech bubble. Sidebar counts for favorites, reviews, and messages are small numbers. The header envelope always shows its number.
- The list is ordered by latest activity. With no conversation in the URL, open the first row. A row highlights on hover, and the open row stays highlighted. Leave `?trainer=` alone until that thread is ready.
- In a dialog the given name and surname are one line. Do not label the thread «Открыта» or «Закрыта». The composer uses 14px text.
- Admin and superadmin cabinets use `.layout-staff` (1680px). Trainer and account cabinets stay on 1240px.

## Live updates

Poll every 5 seconds while the tab is visible (`MESSAGE_SCAN_MS`). Pause when `document.visibilityState` is `hidden`. Do not add WebSocket or SSE. A later self-hosted PartyKit keeps this schema.

```ts
// wrong: raw HTML length, or the wide staff grid on a trainer page
if (input.body.length > 500) throw new Error("too long");

// right: visible characters, Russian AuthError, staff width only around /admin
if (reviewTextLength(html) > limit) {
  throw new AuthError("Первое сообщение тренеру — не длиннее 1000 символов.", "VALIDATION");
}
```

Server writes stay in `src/lib/messages/functions.ts` with `POST` and `requireAuthMiddleware`. `beforeLoad` is not the security boundary.
